			PRINTDL For some reason the conversation with Patchouli just turns into a confusing mess.
			PRINTFORMW 「No, that's not what I... Let's see, how should I say this......」
		ELSEIF !RAND:6
			PRINTFORML 「I didn't realize this until Koakuma told me, but......」
			PRINTFORMDL Patchouli looks towards you.
			PRINTFORMW 「Apparently whenever I concentrate too hard on reading, I have a habit of making things around me float about.」
		ELSEIF !RAND:5
			PRINTFORML 「There seems to be an event called Valentine's in the outside world.」
			PRINTFORML 「I'm told it's a day where you give chocolate to the person you love, or something like that...」
			PRINTFORMDL Patchouli gives you an impish smile.
			PRINTFORMW 「Naturally, you will look for ingredients I can use to reward you with chocolate, no?」
