			PRINTFORMW 「The grimoire I read the other day was no good... I never expected there to be so many places needing revision.」
		ELSEIF !RAND:3
			PRINTFORML 「I can't be without a book. Since a me without a book wouldn't be me.」
			PRINTFORMDL You feel just a little envious of the books.
			PRINTFORMW 「It's alright, %CALLNAME:MASTER% is essential as well.」
		ELSEIF !RAND:2
			PRINTFORML 「I saw something called a gravure photo collection from the outside world......」
			PRINTFORMDW While feeling %HIS_HER(54)% breasts, Patchouli mutters to herself solemnly,
			PRINTFORMW 「I think if they were just a little bit bigger they'd be in the way though.」
		ELSE
			GOTO TALKING2
		ENDIF
	;言葉が見つからない
	ELSEIF TCVAR:302
		;簡易に
		CALL D_LINE ;custom code
		PRINTFORMDL You go "...Um..." and "...Err..." repeatedly and begin to lose your composure.
		PRINTFORML 「......Eh? Oh....... Mh-hm......」
		PRINTDW Patchouli too replies with something unclear.
	;うふふ解禁状態
	ELSEIF CFLAG:6 >= 2
		$TALKING2
		;怒り
