	ELSEIF CFLAG:6 == 1
		;怒り
		IF CFLAG:318 && TCVAR:353 != 1
			PRINTFORML 「.........」
			PRINTFORMDW You are frantically looking for a conversation topic, but Patchouli doesn't seem to care.
			TCVAR:353 |= 1
		ELSEIF CFLAG:318
			PRINTFORML 「...... You do know why I'm angry, right?」
