		ELSEIF TFLAG:193 == 1
			PRINTFORML 「Oh～ What an interesting story.」
			PRINTFORMDW Patchouli urges you to continue.
		;会話大失敗
		ELSEIF TFLAG:193 == -1
			PRINTFORML 「...... Is this story going to go on for long?」
