ELSEIF TALENT:恋慕
	PRINTFORML 「Eh, Going to sleep already?」
	PRINTFORMDL You nod and get in the bed, Patchouli promptly joining you.
	PRINTFORML 「How unreasonable to bring me here and then go to sleep first. I'll have you stay like this until I'm satisfied.」
